WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,120
This is what it means to become stronger.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:06,780
Maybe dying would be a relief.

3
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:08,780
I don't even dare to open the box now

4
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:10,780
The monsters inside are too strong

5
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,780
I opened three boxes in a row today

6
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:13,780
Not a bite to eat

7
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,780
I'm so hungry that I lose consciousness

8
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:16,780
desperate

9
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,780
so big

10
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,780
Survival games should also have the hope of survival, right?

11
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,780
Just forget it if you can’t get enough food to eat.

12
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:23,780
They also opened empty boxes with only monsters and no supplies.

13
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:27,030
Is this a survival incident after leaving the protector?

14
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:29,030
I really can't live anymore

15
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:31,030
I will give you another big surprise and add a batch of zero and seventy items

16
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:33,030
You explain communication for me

17
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:35,030
You can exchange it with any material, right?

18
00:00:35,030 --> 00:00:36,030
Survival must be limited

19
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:38,030
You keep 10% of the transaction for yourself

20
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:39,030
There is also commission

21
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:41,030
It’s okay for a boss to be domineering

22
00:00:41,030 --> 00:00:43,030
Thank you, boss, for saving my dog’s life. Hug.

23
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,030
Help me get these supplies

24
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:48,300
All are put on the shelves and received in the trading hall.

25
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,300
Boss Dugu has put food on the trading floor

26
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,300
Can be taken directly

27
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,300
If you have any other needs, please contact me directly.

28
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:55,620
Finally got some replacement food

29
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:56,620
No need to die

30
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:58,620
Got it, got it

31
00:00:58,620 --> 00:00:59,620
A dog can live for another three days
